1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 1=

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,900
♪Kiss me slower♪

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,700
♪Come closer♪

7
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:20,679
Mr. Xie, you're drunk.

8
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:26,000
♪Stay there♪

9
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Your eyes are on my lips♪

10
00:00:31,854 --> 00:00:34,600
♪Your breath is on my skin♪

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,500
♪We both know what to say♪

12
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,800
♪We all need the one who gives in♪

13
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:44,145
♪Kiss me slower slower...♪

14
00:00:44,145 --> 00:00:46,960
♪Slower than before♪

15
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:50,245
♪Give me one take♪

16
00:00:50,245 --> 00:00:53,200
♪Just a little more♪

17
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:56,680
♪Touch my lips♪

18
00:00:56,680 --> 00:01:00,000
♪Then call my name♪

19
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:03,560
♪Kiss me slower slower...♪

20
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,000
♪Make me wake♪

21
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:14,840
(Oh no, no, no.)

22
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,120
(My life is over.)

23
00:01:16,959 --> 00:01:18,079
(Didn't Xie Bao'er say)

24
00:01:18,239 --> 00:01:20,079
(Xie Zhouhan was practically celibate?)

25
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,959
(This is what she calls impotent?)

26
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:31,040
(He's never been with a woman?)

27
00:01:32,239 --> 00:01:34,000
(Bao'er, this is all your fault!)

28
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:38,560
(One Week Earlier)
Gu Zheng is such a jerk!

29
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,400
He kept you, his childhood sweetheart,
on the hook,

30
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:41,760
then, to benefit his family,

31
00:01:41,879 --> 00:01:43,480
got engaged to Li Sirong!

32
00:01:47,959 --> 00:01:49,480
Business matters more than love.

33
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,159
I...

34
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,799
He said

35
00:01:53,239 --> 00:01:54,560
I'm just their adopted daughter,

36
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,239
not good enough to be his wife.

37
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,519
Only Li Sirong

38
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:03,280
can help his family.

39
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,000
Zheng.

40
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,520
What are you going to do about Lin Hua?

41
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,680
She's been with your family for years.

42
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,199
Lin Hua's just a girl we took in.

43
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:20,639
She has no parents,

44
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:22,319
no family connections.

45
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,000
She's nowhere near our league.

46
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:28,759
You're the only one

47
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:32,039
who deserves to be my fiancee.

48
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,439
What a load of crap!

49
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:47,319
He takes your love for granted.

50
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:49,560
He'd rather suck up to the Li family!

51
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:53,879
Forget it.

52
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:56,120
There's no point talking about it.

53
00:02:59,280 --> 00:02:59,800
Hua.

54
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:02,319
Want to see his whole family

55
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:04,479
lose it?

56
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:08,159
What's your crazy idea this time?

57
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,599
Marry my dad.

58
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,400
Xie Zhouhan.

59
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:16,280
Your dad?

60
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:22,280
But he's ten years older than me.

61
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,439
So what?

62
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,879
It'll just be a contract marriage.

63
00:03:26,159 --> 00:03:26,719
Besides,

64
00:03:26,879 --> 00:03:28,159
here's the best part.

65
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:29,319
He's

66
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:30,960
rich,

67
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:32,599
hot,

68
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:35,759
and he's always been cold.

69
00:03:35,879 --> 00:03:38,000
He's practically a monk. No sex drive.

70
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,840
You won't have to do any of those

71
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:40,919
wifely duties.

72
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:41,680
Plus,

73
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:43,520
you'll have the Gus under your thumb.

74
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:46,159
It's a sure win!

75
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,560
I...

76
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,400
He says

77
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:53,439
he wants someone sweet, sensible,

78
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,240
and talented.

79
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:59,159
You're perfect for him!

80
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:00,680
And

81
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,560
with me around,

82
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,840
he won't mistreat you.

83
00:04:03,759 --> 00:04:04,280
Then,

84
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:06,719
once we've gotten enough out of this,

85
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,680
you can divorce him.

86
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:08,879
After that,

87
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,199
we'll travel the world together!

88
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:18,439
Okay.

89
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,160
As long as no feelings are involved,

90
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,399
I'll marry him.

91
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:31,199
This is a contract marriage.

92
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:32,759
We live separate lives.

93
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,800
Stay out of each other's business.

94
00:04:35,759 --> 00:04:36,639
I expect you to honor that.

95
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,160
(Bao'er wasn't lying.)

96
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:49,480
(He really has no interest in women.)

97
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,600
(Signature page: Party A, Xie Zhouhan)

98
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:02,040
Fen will take care of you.

99
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,519
If you need anything,

100
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:05,240
just ask her.

101
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:07,920
Okay.

102
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,519
If that's all, I'll be going.

103
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,360
(How can I ever face him again?)

104
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,519
- Morning.
- Morning.

105
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,759
Fen made you breakfast.

106
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,800
It's all my favorites.

107
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,959
How did she know what I like?

108
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:46,920
Bao'er told her.

109
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,360
About last night...

110
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:57,680
I got carried away.

111
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,240
I'm sorry.

112
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:04,959
It's okay.

113
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,439
When you go to school in a bit,

114
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,560
I'll have the driver take you.

115
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:22,839
No need.

116
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,680
I can drive myself.

117
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:26,519
Okay.

118
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:37,439
There are cherries in the fridge,
freshly flown in.

119
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,240
Try some.

120
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,360
♪Endless romance, boundless love♪

121
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,840
♪I long to tell you how I miss you♪

122
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,280
♪Over and over again♪

123
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:48,800
♪May we feel that first spark♪

124
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,600
♪Still feel it after all these years♪

125
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,800
(He even knows I love cherries.)

126
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,560
(Did Bao'er spill the beans again?)

127
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:59,440
♪Slowly falling in love♪

128
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:13,240
♪You keep running through my mind♪

129
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:16,000
♪One look at you♪

130
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,440
♪Was all it took to leave me in awe♪
(Signature page: Party A, Xie Zhouhan)

131
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:23,320
♪How can I show my love naturally?♪

132
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:27,400
♪Too much? Too little? I'm afraid♪

133
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:30,080
♪Raindrops fall outside the window♪

134
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,560
♪You lower your eyes and softly smile♪

135
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,760
♪I want to hold your hand through life♪

136
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,080
♪Year after year♪

137
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,560
♪Day after day♪

138
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:40,080
♪I can't help longing for you♪

139
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:43,320
♪Lost in your eyes again♪

140
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:47,680
♪I never want to leave your arms♪

141
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,200
♪Tonight, our sweet time unfolds♪

142
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,720
♪Endless romance, boundless love♪

143
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,920
♪I long to tell you how I miss you♪

144
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,160
♪Over and over♪

145
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,840
♪Again and again♪

146
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:00,320
♪May we feel that first spark♪

147
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:03,680
♪Still feel it after all these years♪

148
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:07,760
♪Through the years, with you by my side♪

149
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:10,400
♪Raindrops fall outside the window♪

150
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,920
♪You lower your eyes and softly smile♪

151
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:15,120
♪I want to hold your hand through life♪

152
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,440
♪Year after year♪

153
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,920
♪Day after day♪

154
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:20,440
♪I can't help longing for you♪

155
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:23,680
♪Lost in your eyes again♪

156
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:28,040
♪I never want to leave your arms♪

157
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:30,280
♪Tonight, our sweet time unfolds♪
